<title>FINLAND: INTERBANK Q1 PROFIT UP TO FIM 3.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>INTERBANK Q1 PROFIT UP TO FIM 3.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 3.3 vs 1.0</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			0.6 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	 7.8 vs 7.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.30 vs 0.09</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	     12.5 vs 23.1</p>
<p> Dividend income				    0.8 vs 0.1</p>
<p> Commission income				  5.1 vs 3.2</p>
<p> Commission expenses				0.5 vs 0.3</p>
<p>Net income from securities transactions</p>
<p> and forex dealings				 1.8 vs 3.3</p>
<p> Other operating income			   2.9 vs 2.9</p>
<p> TOTAL INCOME					17.9 vs 17.0</p>
<p> Personnel expenses				 6.5 vs 6.9</p>
<p> Other administrative expenses		  3.2 vs 4.6</p>
<p> Depreciation					 2.2 vs 2.2</p>
<p> Other operating expenses			 2.1 vs 1.6</p>
<p> PROFIT BEFORE APPROPRIATIONS AND TAXES     3.3 vs 1.8 loss</p>
<p> NET PROFIT					   3.3 vs 1.8 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Finnish bank is Interbank</p>
<p>Osakepankki.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
